---
title: Security
description: How to report a vulnerability in nullish.
---

Found a security issue? Thanks for helping keep nullish safe.

## Report a vulnerability

Please don't disclose it publicly until it's fixed. Report it through:

- [GitHub Security Advisories](https://github.com/usenullish/nullish/security/advisories/new)
- [hi@usenullish.com](mailto:hi@usenullish.com)

Include what you found, how to reproduce it, its potential impact, and any idea you have to fix it.

We answer promptly and release a fix as soon as possible once the issue is confirmed.

## Disclosure

Once a fix is released, we disclose the issue publicly. If there's still no fix after 90 days, we disclose it anyway.

## Supported versions

Only the latest version of nullish receives security fixes.
